{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Trilogy Finale Is Here!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An arcade classic returns with the final Brick Breaker in the trilogy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Blippy\u2014the heroic paddle standing between Earth and The Evil Snarfers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through 50 brand-new, challenging levels as the story reaches its final chapters. Your mission is clear: rid the planet of the Snarfers once and for all, save Earth, and earn your happily-ever-after with Princess Paddle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master classic power-ups, unleash the new Multi-Shot Laser Paddle, and push to the finish to unlock the final ending cutscenes for this trilogy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50 brand-new challenging levels to complete</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as Blippy, the heroic paddle</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Final chapters of the trilogy\u2019s heroic storyline</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mission to save Earth and marry Princess Paddle</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic power-ups to power through tougher stages</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Multi-Shot Laser Paddle for extra firepower</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock the final ending cutscenes by completing the game</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gamepad Support</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/874810?t=1769100174","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/874810/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769100174","capsule_image":"https://sha